From 96b132e38705e479f3e0e7efc020b717e0c9d609 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:52:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Admin: allotment letter + debenture certificate in Landmaxo
 draft format, KYC step edit, clean payout export
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Allotment Letter: 'Date : DD-MM-YYYY', narrow addressee block, Mr./Ms.,
  'Subject :' line, Board-meeting date '19th of March, 2026', tenure in
  words, centred table; Distinctive 'To' was the debenture count (bug) -
  now From + count - 1
- Allotment Letter + Debenture Certificate take folio, distinctive range and
  certificate number from Documents > Allotment (allotments /
  debenture_certificates) when the investment has been allotted
- Debenture Certificate redesigned to the Landmaxo certificate: ribbon
  bands, LANDMAXO mark, company block, black nominal-value band, holder
  rows, GIVEN date '12th October 2026', Director / Director / Authorised
  Signatory; fits one A4 page
- KYC (Queue/Approved/Rejected): Edit button on every step card opens the
  KYC form on that step; saving keeps the step's existing review status and
  the KYC rows' user_id
- Payout CSV: strips non-breaking spaces / invisible characters (the 'AÂ'
  junk), UTF-8 BOM, ' prefix for phone and Aadhar too, always .csv

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BZzZ8gJpzApztfvJjGonBd
